WEBVTT

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.400
It won't happen.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.410
You see that now, don't you?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.410
It

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.410
won't

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.410
happen.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.910
It'll

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.910
never

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.910
happen!

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.910
It'll never happen!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.690
No matter how many times we do this,

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.380
there's never going to be a Princeps mage!

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.840
There'll never be anyone who's good enough!

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.050
Why don't you understand?

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.700
What is it that you <i>want</i>?

00:00:53.070 --> 00:01:03.040
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:02.750
The Two Princeps

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.480
This is...

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.110
the stage prepared by Magiaconatus.

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:39.900
Wow...

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.040
It's calling...

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.110
Shingetsu-chan!

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.590
Suishou...

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.270
Welcome.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:22.780
This is where you'll find the altar 
that awaits the Princeps mage.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:27.720
All of the magical power sealed 
here is awaiting its master!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:29.720
That's where...

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.820
So that's the actual seal.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:45.150
Yes, it's the crystallization 
of all magical power.

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.670
Its light shines upon the mages

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:51.560
and awakens their desire for the magical 
power that once existed in the world.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.620
Humans are kept alive by the sun,

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.040
and mages are kept alive by the moon.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.590
What does that mean?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.970
It's a saying passed down
 within mage families.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.380
Then...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.240
In the distant past,

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:07.200
the people feared becoming
 entranced by magical power,

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.390
so all magical power in 
the world was sealed away.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:15.020
But it still continued to entrance 
people. That's what it means.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.700
To escape that power...

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:20.990
...is absolutely impossible!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:28.030
If you think I'm the same as before, 
this will be over in an instant!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:29.540
I won't let it!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:32.730
Mangetsu!

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:33.960
Shingetsu-chan!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.800
Damn you!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.020
Now, that's not fair, is it?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:57.160
We're fighting to decide which of us 
is fit to become the mage, right?

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.120
<i>That's right.</i>

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.230
<i>And that's exactly why I'm doing this.</i>

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:05.990
If it will make me the Princeps mage...

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.120
You don't care what you have to do, eh?

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.740
You can believe that if you want.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.640
I love it.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:16.620
That's a human for you. 
That's a mage for you.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.880
<i>They're self-serving, dirty...</i>

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.170
cowards.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.280
Orca!

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.120
Shingetsu-chan!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:32.730
I...

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.140
...will eliminate all magic!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:41.100
You actually think you can top me in speed?!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.860
I possess the best of all natural talents!

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.910
Power, technique, speed...

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.350
Everything that someone 
with magical power needs!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:57.410
<i>Everything</i> that a mage needs!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.290
Do you know why?

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:05.800
Because I have also received 
the blessing of Magiaconatus!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.190
Blessing?

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:11.550
A thousand years ago, when 
Magiaconatus was born,

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:14.090
I received my orders.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:21.910
"Prove that there is no human 
worthy of becoming the mage.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:26.440
Put all who have gathered in hopes 
of becoming the mage through a test,

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:30.590
and prove to them that none are worthy."

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:36.120
That was the order I was 
given a thousand years ago.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:41.250
And when I prove this fact, I will 
become the Princeps mage!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.340
That is why I have continued to fight!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.420
There is no human fit to 
become the true mage!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.630
No matter how many times GRANBELM repeats,

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:56.060
there will <i>never</i> be a single human 
found worthy of the title!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.600
I've spent all this time proving that!

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:00.940
That there are <i>none</i>—

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.360
other than me—who are 
fit to become the mage!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.650
Again... and again...

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.570
and again... and again...

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.570
and <i>again</i>!

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:16.790
And yet...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.500
GRANBELM still continues.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.190
You still haven't become the mage,

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:25.550
even after winning every 
single GRANBELM thus far!

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:27.880
And that's exactly why it's so infuriating.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.710
I think I understand what you are now.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.420
How many times do you think I've done this?

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.910
Isn't it clear to you now?

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.640
It won't happen.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.280
None of you can become the mage.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.050
So how...

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:51.210
How can it be that you...

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:54.870
Now!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.370
You fool!

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.080
Shingetsu-chan!

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.420
I'm not finished!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.380
Medusa!

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:43.620
What?!

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:47.210
This is...

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.210
Orca!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.320
Suishou...

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.330
You think that was enough?

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.400
She can use this?

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:19.140
<i>Is this the blessing of Magiaconatus?</i>

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:26.000
Didn't I tell you that Magiaconatus 
has granted me power?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.500
You're wrong.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:33.350
If this were truly the 
blessing of Magiaconatus,

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:35.550
you would have become the mage by now.

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:38.280
But you haven't!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:42.610
Magiaconatus is waiting for its master...

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.770
for the one who would overcome 
you, the thousand-year trial,

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.400
and arrive at its side!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.820
Shut up!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.490
Do you think I didn't expect that?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:08.240
Obviously, I knew you were going to—

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.290
Mangetsu!

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.730
Just...

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.020
kidding!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.150
Growth...

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.360
Shingetsu-chan!

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.500
Gotcha...

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.710
<i>Shingetsu Ernesta Fukami.</i>

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.210
Shingetsu-chan!

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.920
In all the thousand years I've stood here,

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:03.390
there has been no other so loved 
by Magiaconatus as you are.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.350
So if I defeat you...

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:10.440
If I prove that I'm the one who is worthy...

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.710
I will...

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:16.140
I <i>will</i>...

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:16.860
Shingetsu-chan!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.370
Shingetsu-chan!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.750
Mangetsu...

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.570
Shi...

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.000
Shingetsu-chan!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.050
Shingetsu-chan...

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.600
Shingetsu-chan! Shingetsu-chan!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.720
Are you surprised?

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.990
I suppose you would be.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.950
You planned to sacrifice yourself

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:14.630
so that Shingetsu could 
become the mage, after all!

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:22.010
You should expect that.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:25.310
You are a doll, after all.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.650
Ugly. It's all so ugly.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:46.110
You two really were only 
looking out for yourselves,

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:52.890
and even a doll's ended up 
tainted by such ugly emotions.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:59.380
You only gave precedence to your own desires.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:03.380
All you cared about was yourself, your 
family, your lovers, your friends...

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:06.760
You couldn't care less about the world.

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:24.420
What's...

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.070
so bad about that?

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.770
Of course it's bad!

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:33.370
The mage destined to possess all 
the magical power in the world

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.770
can't be like that!

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.020
Then that means you...

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:40.710
can't be the mage, either!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:48.050
In the end, all you want is to 
become the mage yourself!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.880
You don't understand a single thing!

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.760
I want to protect the ones I love!

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.360
I want the people I care most about to smile!

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.200
I want to be helpful to someone! 
I want to try my best!

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.470
That's all!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.360
I believe that's all everyone wants!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.280
Then why did they create magical power?!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.530
Why did they create Magiaconatus?!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:18.070
When it comes down to it, they try 
to brute force their way through.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.590
They give precedence to their own desires,

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:23.970
and they'll do whatever 
it takes to achieve them!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.690
For a thousand years!

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.760
A thousand years, and not 
a <i>single</i> thing has changed!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:33.140
But that's why Shingetsu-chan is trying 
to rid the world of that power!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.560
If she truly wished to rid the world of it,

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.630
she wouldn't have lost to me!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.350
This is...

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:50.990
Did you think that was the end,

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.520
you little doll?!

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.950
<i>You are a doll!</i>

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:05.960
<i>You were made to test her, 
based on what's in her heart.</i>

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.840
<i>You were made to give her heart support...</i>

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.080
<i>and then to </i>break<i> it!</i>

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:10.970
You're wrong!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.170
I'm not a doll!

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:17.180
There's no way I'm a doll!

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:22.440
I'm the crystallization of 
Shingetsu-chan's feelings!

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:27.670
I'm a crystal filled with her 
sadness, her pain, and her wishes!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:28.940
What are you—

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.980
So I will not break!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:35.610
And I won't let Shingetsu-chan's 
heart be broken!

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:39.640
Wh-What?

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.150
This is JI GUAN LONG's...

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:15.020
Yeah. It's what JI GUAN LONG 
used to make itself invisible.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.840
She said you were free to use it.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:22.590
I'm sure that girl will try to defeat 
you before she comes after me.

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.440
After all, I'm...

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:26.710
a doll.

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.590
Mangetsu...

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:32.520
So if you're in trouble, act 
like you've lost and run away.

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:34.810
I'll keep her attention until the end.

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:38.200
I'll do whatever damage I can.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:40.180
No! You can't...

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:45.280
This is...

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.990
what I want you to do.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.330
Mangetsu...

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:10.500
Why?

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:13.860
What hope could a doll have?

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.800
You don't have anything left at all!

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:33.170
You aren't protected by magic,

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.420
the one you wanted to protect is gone,

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:38.820
and even if she came back, there's 
no guarantee you'd still exist!

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:40.100
And yet...

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.050
You actually think you'll win?!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:52.760
You, a doll, a thing created by Magiaconatus,

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:55.970
think you have the <i>right</i> to 
become the Princeps mage?!

00:17:57.650 --> 00:17:59.870
I have no intention of becoming the mage.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:04.160
I know I'm not human.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:08.090
I was created solely to test Shingetsu-chan.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:12.190
But still... I have to do it.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:16.860
Someone has to rid the 
world of magical power!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.910
I know nothing will change.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:24.620
Even if I get rid of all magic, 
it won't change anything.

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.670
Nothing in this world is that simple!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:39.970
But...

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.600
The world is filled with so many feelings!

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:55.100
Feelings like happiness, enjoyment, love...

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.990
And of course, that's not all.

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.950
There's frustration, sadness, hate...

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:07.160
There's regret, and desire...

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:11.620
Hoping things will turn out the way 
you want, wishing for a miracle...

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.210
There are so many wishes 
that can't be fulfilled.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.210
They're forgotten, and then 
they gush forth again,

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.800
eternally building this world.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:22.420
<i>Humans live on...</i>

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:24.610
<i>And that's good enough.</i>

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:27.770
<i>That's how people can have hope,</i>

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.170
<i>how they can live!</i>

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:32.310
That's why, Shingetsu-chan...

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:39.570
We don't need magical power.

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:47.640
Power that can warp the whole 
world just to grant one wish...

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:51.070
Power that can erase things we don't like...

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:53.080
No one needs such tremendous power.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:57.300
That's not what hope is.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.190
It's not our future!

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:17.520
Something that everyone in
 the world wants shouldn't exist!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.320
A mere doll...

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.610
shouldn't ramble on and on and <i>on</i>!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.950
Disappear!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:01.620
I'm not done!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.960
Mangetsu...

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.110
Shingetsu-chan...

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:28.260
The moon... is incredible...

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:35.890
Mangetsu!

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:10.720
Mangetsu...

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:22.920
Mangetsu!

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.750
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:58.440 --> 00:24:01.500
<i>The Princeps mage is born at last.</i>

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.960
<i>The one true mage in the whole world,</i>

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:08.020
<i>the one and only witch in the whole world.</i>

00:24:08.570 --> 00:24:11.750
<i>The girl who was sought out 
for so long by Magiaconatus</i>

00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:15.250
<i>falls to her knees for the 
sake of her one and only wish.</i>

00:24:16.110 --> 00:24:17.810
<i>Next time on </i>GRANBELM<i>,</i>

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:20.810
<b>For the Only Two of Their Kind in the World</b>

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:20.810
<i>"For the Only Two of 
Their Kind in the World."</i>

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:24.670
<i>What has her magic changed?</i>

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.030
<b>Look forward to the next episode!</b>
